# CTY-1: the views (zones, value, whole), riding along, the help card, the idle view, the remote, the secret
spin PRESET 9
wait 4000
tap GLO
tap GLO
spin K3 1
wait 400
shot scr_zones.png
spin K3 1
wait 400
shot scr_value.png
spin K3 -2
spin K2 2
wait 2500
shot scr_whole.png
spin K2 -2
tap HOME
tap SEL
wait 2500
press LFO
wait 1200
shot scr_help.png
release LFO
expect view 0
spin K4 1
wait 62000
expect full 1
shot scr_idle.png
tap HOME
expect full 0
press SEL
tap EDIT
release SEL
expect game 1
wait 3000
key w2 down
wait 4000
key w2 up
shot scr_game.png
tap HOME
expect game 0
press SEL
tap GLO
release SEL
expect remote 1
midi BF 75 7F
wait 50
expect remote 2
press SEL
tap GLO
release SEL
expect remote 0
